  "content": {
    "format": "markdown",
    "text": "# Quarterly results for the ferry cooperative\n\nThe cooperative carried more passengers than in any previous quarter, but fuel costs rose faster than fares.\n\n| Line item | Q1 | Q2 | Change |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Passenger fares | 1,204,000 | 1,388,500 | +15.3% |\n| Fuel | 402,100 | 497,900 | +23.8% |\n| Crew wages | 511,000 | 519,400 | +1.6% |\n| **Operating surplus** | 290,900 | 371,200 | +27.6% |\n\nMembers will vote on a fare adjustment at the annual meeting."
